        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>First Impressions DLW5012CRGFBR, Offset 12 Inch Ornate Delaware Door Handle</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Offset 12 Inch Ornate Door Pull has a traditional feel that makes it a great choice for classically styled homes. It can be thru-bolt mounted, back-to-back mounted, or surface mounted on wood, fiberglass, glass, or metal doors. The 12 Inch Ornate Delaware Door Handle has a 9.26 mounting center to center. Choose from a wide selection of beautiful finishes including powder coat matte black and satin brass.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/FII-DLW06-specifications.gif?v=1704354503\" width=\"427\" height=\"318\" border=\"0\" alt=\"First Impressions DLW5012CRGFBR Dimensions Diagram\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Delaware 5 Offset Door Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 12.01\"</li>\r\n<li>Mounting Center to Center: 9.26\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 2.39\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 1.19\"</li>\r\n<li>Max Diameter: 1.02\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/FII-DLW06-specifications.pdf?v=1704262327\"><b>First Impressions DLW5012CRGFBR Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNote: This beautiful door pull is handmade in the USA when you order it—allowing it to be custom designed to fit your specific door application, including <b>Other Lengths</b>. Unfortunately, because of the made-to-order nature of the door handle, it is <b>Not Cancelable or Returnable.</b> Please <a href=\"/pages/contact\">Contact Us</a> with your requirements or if you have any questions.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Mounting Hardware:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Thru-Bolted Mounting:</b> Pull bolts through the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Surface Mounting:</b> Pull screws to the face of the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Back-to-Back Mounting:</b> Pulls bolt to each other through the door. <b>Requires 2 pulls</b>.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold individually (1 door pull handle). If you order Back-to-Back Mounting please Order 2 Pulls.</i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Offset 12 Inch Ornate Door Pull",
                "description": "The Offset 12 Inch Ornate Door Pull has a traditional feel that makes it a great choice for classically styled homes. It can be thru-bolt mounted, back-to-back mounted, or surface mounted on wood, fiberglass, glass, or metal doors. The 12 Inch Ornate Delaware Door Handle has a 9.26 mounting center to center. Choose from a wide selection of beautiful finishes including powder coat matte black and satin brass.",
